{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":142,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ܡܲܣܟܝܼܠܔ ܕܕܘܝܕ، ܐܝܡܢ ܕܝܗܘܐ ܓܘ ܓܦܝܬ‌ܐ. ܨܠܘܬ‌ܐ."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܒܩܵܠܝܼ ܠܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܟܹܐ ܡܲܩܘܸܚܸܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܩܵܠܝܼ ܠܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܟܹܐ ܦܲܪܦܸܠܸܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܹܐ ܫܲܦܟܸܢ ܩܲܕܡܘܼܗ‌ܝ ܩܒ݂ܵܠܬ‌ܝܼ.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܥܵܘܩܵܢܝܼ ܩܲܕܡܘܼܗ‌ܝ ܟܹܐ ܡܲܕܥܸܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܲܕ ܒܓܵܘܝܼ ܕܘܼܪܕܸܫ̃ ܠܵܗ̇ ܪܘܼܚܝܼ، ܐܲܢ݇ܬ ܟܹܐ ܝܵܕܥܹܬ ܠܹܗ ܫܒ݂ܝܼܠܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܐܘܼܪܚܵܐ ܕܟܹܐ ܚܵܕܪܹܢ، ܛܘܼܫܹܐ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܢܸܫܒ݂ܵܐ ܐܸܠܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܚܘܼܪ ܠܝܲܡܝܼܢܵܐ، ܘܚܙܝܼ ܕܠܲܝܬ ܠܝܼ ܝܵܕܥܵܢܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܛܠܝܼܩ ܠܵܗ̇ ܡܸܢܝܼ ܕܘܼܟܬܵ‌ܐ ܕܥܪܵܩܬܵ‌ܐ، ܠܲܝܬ ܒܲܩܪܵܢܵܐ ܒܘܼܬ ܓܵܢܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܘܼܩܘܸܚ ܠܝܼ ܠܟܸܣܠܘܼܟ݂، ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܡܝܼܪܝܼ: ܐܲܢ݇ܬ ܝܼܘܸܬ ܒܹܝܬ ܓܵܘܣܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܵܗܡܝܼ ܒܐܲܪܥܵܐ ܕܚܲܝܹ̈ܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܨܘܼܬ ܠܓܥܵܝܬ‌ܝܼ ܒܗ̇ܝ ܕܦܝܼܫ ܠܝܼ ܡܘܼܟܸܦܵܐ ܪܵܒܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܦܲܨܝܼ ܠܝܼ ܡ̣ܢ ܢܵܦܠܵܢܹ̈ܐ ܒܵܬܪܝܼ ܒܗ̇ܝ ܕܒܘܼܫ ܚܲܝܠܵܢܹ̈ܐ ܝܢܵܐ ܡܸܢܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܦܲܠܸܛ ܠܵܗ̇ ܓܵܢܝܼ ܡ̣ܢ ܒܹܝܬ ܚܒ݂ܘܼܫܝܵܐ ܕܫܲܟܪܸܢ ܠܫܸܡܘܼܟ݂،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܚܵܕܸܪ̈ܘܵܢܝܼ ܒܸܬ ܟܵܪܟ݂ܝܼ ܙܲܕܝܼܩܹ̈ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܗ̇ܝ ܕܒܦܸܪܝܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ ܒܸܬ ܦܵܪܥܹܬ ܠܝܼ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/142.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/143.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/141.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}